{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44113","headline":"贻郑昌图 · 楚儿","name":"贻郑昌图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"应是前生有宿冤，不期今世恶因缘。\n蛾眉欲碎巨灵掌，鸡肋难胜子路拳。\n秪拟吓人传铁券，未应教我踏青莲。\n曲江昨日君相遇，当下遭他数十鞭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"楚儿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44113.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44113","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}